{"title": "Legendary Action: Ocular Nightmare", "pageid": 45209, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Ocular_Nightmare", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ocular_Nightmare.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Ocular_Nightmare.webp/300px-Ocular_Nightmare.webp, /w/images/b/b6/Ocular_Nightmare.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Ocular_Nightmare.webp/300px-Ocular_Nightmare.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Ocular_Nightmare.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Ocular Nightmare</b> is a passive feature available to the <a href=\"/wiki/Spectator\" title=\"Spectator\">Spectator</a>, that lets it use a <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Legendary action\">legendary action</a> to attack all creatures nearby with eye beams.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>After accumulating five <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paranoid_Dreams_(Condition)\" title=\"Paranoid Dreams (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paranoid Dreams\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Paranoid_Dreams_(Condition)\" title=\"Paranoid Dreams (Condition)\">Paranoid Dreams</a>, the Spectator will spend a Legendary Action to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ocular_Nightmare\" title=\"Ocular Nightmare\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp/25px-Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp/38px-Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp/50px-Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ocular Nightmare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp/25px-Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ocular_Nightmare\" title=\"Ocular Nightmare\">Ocular Nightmare</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i>\n</p>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Paranoid Dream increases if the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spectator\" title=\"Spectator\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png/25px-Portrait_Spectator.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png/38px-Portrait_Spectator.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png/50px-Portrait_Spectator.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spectator\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png/25px-Portrait_Spectator.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spectator\" title=\"Spectator\">Spectator</a> is targeted with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour\" title=\"Mage Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/25px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/38px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/50px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mage Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/25px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour\" title=\"Mage Armour\">Mage Armour</a> cast by one of the formerly petrified Drow.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202336\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1395/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9531/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4690/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExp